"网络能力自证" = "Network Self-Certification";
"数据都在本机，不上传云端" = "All data stays on this Mac — nothing is uploaded";
"Coffer 的密码库与全部数据只保存在本机，不上传到任何云端。Rust 核心与其依赖图零网络（可用 tools/check_no_network.sh 自证）；应用层唯一联网例外是软件更新（OTA）——仅按白名单地址访问更新服务器，不发送任何密码库数据。以下命令可自行验证，步骤可复现。" = "Coffer's vault and all of its data are stored only on this Mac and uploaded to no cloud. The Rust core and its dependency graph make no network calls (verifiable with tools/check_no_network.sh). The only network exception in the app layer is software update (OTA), which contacts update servers on an allowlist only and never sends vault data. The commands below let you verify this yourself; the steps are reproducible.";
"静态自证（构建产物）" = "Static Proof (build artifacts)";
"检查沙盒权限声明：" = "Check the sandbox entitlements:";
"codesign -d --entitlements - <Coffer.app 路径>" = "codesign -d --entitlements - <path to Coffer.app>";
"输出中最多允许出现一项网络权限：com.apple.security.network.client（软件更新豁免）；不得出现 network.server 或其他任何 com.apple.security.network.* 键。" = "The output may contain at most one network entitlement: com.apple.security.network.client (the software update exemption). network.server and any other com.apple.security.network.* key must not appear.";
"检查动态链接的框架：" = "Check dynamically linked frameworks:";
"输出中不应链接第三方网络库；系统框架 CFNetwork 属预期——仅被软件更新（OTA）模块经 URLSession 使用，不应出现独立的 Network.framework。" = "The output should show no third-party network library. The system framework CFNetwork is expected — it is used only by the software update (OTA) module via URLSession; a standalone Network.framework should not appear.";
"运行时自证（0 socket）" = "Runtime Proof (0 sockets)";
"启动 Coffer 后查看进程 ID：" = "Start Coffer, then look up its process ID:";
"检查该进程的 TCP/UDP 连接（-a 限定只查该进程）：" = "Check that process's TCP/UDP connections (-a limits the query to that process):";
"输出应为空，即无任何网络连接——软件更新（OTA）下载进行中除外。" = "The output should be empty, i.e. no network connections at all — except while a software update (OTA) download is in progress.";
"依赖图自证（源码仓库）" = "Dependency Proof (source repository)";
"在 Coffer 源码仓库执行：" = "Run this in the Coffer source repository:";
"依赖中不应出现 reqwest / hyper / tokio(net) 等网络 crate；仓库内 tools/check_no_network.sh 自动断言此项。" = "No network crates such as reqwest / hyper / tokio(net) should appear among the dependencies; tools/check_no_network.sh in the repository asserts this automatically.";
"复制整条命令；<…> 占位符在终端中替换为实际路径/进程 ID" = "Copies the whole command; replace the <…> placeholders in Terminal with the real path / process ID";

